		(at 53.19 42.02)
		(descr "Taoglas GVLB208.A single-feed stacked L1/L5 ceramic patch, 20x20x8.8 mm, feed pin 0.8 mm on the centre line 1.2 mm off centre. Land and clearances per datasheet SPE-25-8-318-B sec. 4.2-4.3 (the same as GVLB258.A): 1.0 mm plated hole, 1.2 mm top pad, 2.2 mm bottom pad; no copper within 3.0 mm dia on the top and inner layers, 3.5 mm dia on the bottom. Silkscreen is the nominal 20.0 x 20.0 mm body outline; courtyard is the +0.2 mm tolerance limit (20.4 mm). Tuned by Taoglas on a 70x70 mm ground plane (https://www.taoglas.com/datasheets/GVLB208.A.pdf)")
